3087:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h **** /**
3088:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @brief  Helper macro to set the value of ADC analog watchdog threshold high
3089:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         or low in function of ADC resolution, when ADC resolution is
3090:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         different of 12 bits.
3091:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   To be used with function @ref LL_ADC_ConfigAnalogWDThresholds()
3092:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         or @ref LL_ADC_SetAnalogWDThresholds().
