 230:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****        (+) ConvCpltCallback               : ADC conversion complete callback
 231:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****        (+) ConvHalfCpltCallback           : ADC conversion DMA half-transfer callback
 232:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****        (+) LevelOutOfWindowCallback       : ADC analog watchdog 1 callback
