6951:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @param  AWDThresholdHighValue Value between Min_Data=0x000 and Max_Data=0xFFF
6952:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @param  AWDThresholdLowValue Value between Min_Data=0x000 and Max_Data=0xFFF
6953:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @retval None
6954:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   */
